From c34ad52c1495176309b893818743da66b0767ef6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zambia Treasury Insight <patch@local>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:38:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] Tier 2 #9: Model documentation endpoint + PDF download

Adds two new endpoints:

  GET /api/model-docs    -> JSON: methodology, sample range, fit summary (R^2,
                            drivers with beta/SE/p-value), backtest metrics
                            (MAE/RMSE/bias/dir_hit/interval_coverage/dm_t)
                            with metric definitions, and per-series data source
                            provenance. The validation_date is the latest obs.

  GET /api/model-docs.pdf -> same content rendered as a one-page PDF using
                             ReportLab (A4, dark-on-white tables). Returns a
                             Content-Disposition: attachment header so the
                             browser downloads it as zti-model-docs.pdf.

reportlab is added to requirements.txt as an optional dependency (the JSON
endpoint works without it; the PDF endpoint returns HTTP 503 with install
instructions if reportlab is missing).

The PDF is suitable for sharing with stakeholders who want the model spec,
validation results and data sources on one printable page.

74 tests passing (1 new, exercises both endpoints).
